OL,3,S#######################################
OL,4,CFive Gladiators will not return for    
OL,5,Cnew BBC series                         
OL,6,GFive Gladiators stars will not be      
OL,7,Greturning to the BBC television show   
OL,8,Gfor its upcoming series, it is         
OL,9,Gunderstood.                            
OL,11,FAthena, Comet, Bionic, Phantom and     
OL,12,FCyclone will not be featured when the  
OL,13,Fshow returns in 2027.                  
OL,15,FA spokesperson for the production said 
OL,16,Fthe departing cast members "remain     
OL,17,Fpart of the wider Gladiators family"   
OL,18,Fand are taking part in the ongoing     
OL,19,Farena tour, which comes to an end in   
OL,20,FDecember.                              
